      "section": "api_reference",
      "slot": "intro",
      "text": "Aspose.Slides FOSS for Python provides the slides_foss module with the Presentation class as the primary entry point, which owns a SlideCollection of Slide objects, each exposing its shapes through Slide.shapes (a ShapeCollection)."
    },
    {
      "fact_ids": [
        "identity:repository",
        "package:license",
        "package:name",
        "package:python_requires",
        "package:version",
        "public_symbol:slides_foss",
        "public_symbol:slides_foss.autoshape.add_text_frame",
        "public_symbol:slides_foss.baseportionformat.font_height",
        "public_symbol:slides_foss.nullablebool",
        "public_symbol:slides_foss.paragraphformat.bullet",
        "public_symbol:slides_foss.presentation.save",
        "public_symbol:slides_foss.shapecollection.add_auto_shape",
        "public_symbol:slides_foss.shapecollection.add_connector",
        "public_symbol:slides_foss.shapecollection.add_table",
        "public_symbol:slides_foss.slidecollection.add_clone",
        "public_symbol:slides_foss.slidecollection.add_empty_slide",
        "public_symbol:slides_foss.slidecollection.remove_at"
      ],
      "section": "api_reference",
      "slot": "hub:public_symbol:slides_foss",
      "text": "The slides_foss module supports creating and modifying presentations through methods such as slides_foss.Presentation.save for saving, slides_foss.SlideCollection.add_empty_slide and slides_foss.SlideCollection.add_clone for adding slides, slides_foss.SlideCollection.remove_at for removing slides, slides_foss.ShapeCollection.add_auto_shape, slides_foss.ShapeCollection.add_table, and slides_foss.ShapeCollection.add_connector for adding shapes, slides_foss.AutoShape.add_text_frame for adding text frames, slides_foss.BasePortionFormat.font_height for text sizing, slides_foss.ParagraphFormat.bullet for bullet formatting, and slides_foss.NullableBool for triple-state boolean values."
    },
